{"comment_text": {"ja26:0.1": "", "ja26:0.2": "", "ja26:0.3": "", "ja26:0.4": "", "ja26:1.1": "A good-natured royal elephant was corrupted after overhearing some bandits speaking evilly. ", "ja26:1.2": "", "ja26:1.3": "", "ja26:1.4": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Aṭṭhā</i> is glossed with <i lang='pi' translate='no'>patiṭṭhito</i>. ", "ja26:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja26:0.1": "<article id='ja26'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja26:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja26:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja26:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja26:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja26:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja26:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja26:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja26:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja26:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja26:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja26:0.3": "Kuruṅgavagga ", "ja26:0.4": "6. Mahiḷāmukhajātaka ", "ja26:1.1": "“Purāṇacorāna vaco nisamma, ", "ja26:1.2": "Mahiḷāmukho pothayamanvacārī; ", "ja26:1.3": "Susaññatānañhi vaco nisamma, ", "ja26:1.4": "Gajuttamo sabbaguṇesu aṭṭhā”ti. ", "ja26:2.1": "Mahiḷāmukhajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja26:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 26 ", "ja26:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja26:0.3": "The Four-horned Antelope ", "ja26:0.4": "The Elephant Named Ladyface: a past life story ", "ja26:1.1": "Before, hearing the speech of the bandits, ", "ja26:1.2": "Ladyface went on a rampage. ", "ja26:1.3": "But hearing the speech of the well-restrained, ", "ja26:1.4": "the supreme elephant is established <j>in all good qualities. ", "ja26:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja26:0.1": "", "ja26:0.2": "", "ja26:0.3": "", "ja26:0.4": "", "ja26:1.1": "", "ja26:1.2": "", "ja26:1.3": "", "ja26:1.4": "", "ja26:2.1": "Mahiḷāmukhajātakaṁ → mahilāmukhajātakaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja26:0.1": "", "ja26:0.2": "", "ja26:0.3": "", "ja26:0.4": "", "ja26:1.1": "ms22J_56, msdiv26, pts-vp-pli1.188, vri68.7", "ja26:1.2": "", "ja26:1.3": "", "ja26:1.4": "", "ja26:2.1": "ms22J_57"}, "keys_order": ["ja26:0.1", "ja26:0.2", "ja26:0.3", "ja26:0.4", "ja26:1.1", "ja26:1.2", "ja26:1.3", "ja26:1.4", "ja26:2.1"]}